<title>POLAND: Polish central bank news conference at 1300 GMT.</title>
<headline>Polish central bank news conference at 1300 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland's deputy president Witold Kozinski called a news conference for 1300 GMT, the bank's press office said.</p>
<p>It said Kozinski would comment on a Wednesday statement by NBP president Hanna Gronkiewicz Waltz in Washington on a possible rise in interest rates.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
